# Kotlin rules

## Scope

- Kotlin 2.0 / JVM 17 style in `app` and tests (see root `build.gradle.kts` — do not assume README aspirational versions)
- Coroutines, Flows, JUnit 4 tests under `app/src/test`

Does **not** cover: JNI C++, Gradle plugin bumps.

## Invariants

1. New logic gets unit tests in the same task (table-ish parameterized where cheap).
2. Orchestrator / classifier / route resolver must be testable without Robolectric when possible (fakes).
3. No `runBlocking` on the main thread in production code (BootReceiver already uses it — do not spread).
4. Match existing naming: `ZerotierB*`, package `com.brukb.zerotier`.

## External docs

**Docs (if stuck):** https://kotlinlang.org/docs/home.html

