## Problem classes

### `Log not mocked in unit tests`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `RuntimeException: Method d in android.util.Log not mocked` during JVM unit tests | Android framework stubs throw unless configured | Set `android.testOptions.unitTests.isReturnDefaultValues = true` in the app module. Prefer not removing `Log` from production just to satisfy tests. |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-08 -->

### `Untestable Android types in resolver`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| RuntimePlan tests need a device | Resolver takes `Network` / `Context` | Pass already-classified `PhysicalLink` data class |

